From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:07:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: backport ipq9574 USB3 PHY pipe clock fix

Backport upstream commit 117d8d40be1d ("arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574:
Wire up USB3 PHY PIPE clock to GCC"), which is marked for stable.

Without it the GCC has no parent for usb0_pipe_clk_src. On an Arista
C-460 a USB 3.0 stick (13fe:6700) enumerated at high speed on the
USB 2.0 root hub, and the SuperSpeed root hub port stayed "not
attached".

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
---
 ...4-Wire-up-USB3-PHY-PIPE-clock-to-GCC.patch | 30 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0101-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq9574-Wire-up-USB3-PHY-PIPE-clock-to-GCC.patch

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0101-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq9574-Wire-up-USB3-PHY-PIPE-clock-to-GCC.patch b/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0101-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq9574-Wire-up-USB3-PHY-PIPE-clock-to-GCC.patch
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..46a249966b8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0101-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq9574-Wire-up-USB3-PHY-PIPE-clock-to-GCC.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+From 117d8d40be1ded4f35f3252efa83607a7134d5e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Kathiravan Thirumoorthy <kathiravan.thirumoorthy@oss.qualcomm.com>
+Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 06:19:37 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574: Wire up USB3 PHY PIPE clock to GCC
+
+Connect the QMP PHY USB3 output to GCC so the USB3 PHY pipe clock can
+propagate to the USB controller.
+
+Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
+Fixes: a98bfb31f676 ("arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574: Add USB related nodes")
+Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
+Signed-off-by: Kathiravan Thirumoorthy <kathiravan.thirumoorthy@oss.qualcomm.com>
+Reviewed-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
+Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260921-ipq_clk_changes-v1-4-d242e3d49648@oss.qualcomm.com
+Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>
+---
+ arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi | 2 +-
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
+
+--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
++++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
+@@ -432,7 +432,7 @@
+ 				 <&pcie1_phy>,
+ 				 <&pcie2_phy>,
+ 				 <&pcie3_phy>,
+-				 <0>;
++				 <&usb_0_qmpphy>;
+ 			#clock-cells = <1>;
+ 			#reset-cells = <1>;
+ 			#interconnect-cells = <1>;
-- 
